You draw constant power from the souls you hold within your grasp.

If you hold at least 2, your mana regeneration is increased by [0.5, 1.3, 1.9, 2.5, 3.0 (TL1-5)] per turn.

If you hold at least 5, your spellpower is increased by [10, 20, 27, 34, 40 (TL1-5)].

If you hold at least 8, all your resistances are increased by [4, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)].
